  "notes": "Optional instrument. Six 3-item components scored as means (1–7); no published cutoffs. Key verified 2026-09-16 against the form's scoring section (satisfaction 1, 7, 13; commitment 2, 8, 14; intimacy 3, 9, 15; trust 4, 10, 16; passion 5, 11, 17; love 6, 12, 18). Before that date the config assumed items grouped by component, which was wrong.",
  "instructions": "Please read each of the following items carefully and, using the rating scale, rate your current partner and relationship (ranging from 1 = not at all to 7 = extremely).",
  "source_url": "https://relationshipscienceonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/RSO-PRQC.pdf",
  "text_source": "Relationship Health Assessment (PRQC) form from relationshipscienceonline.com, transcribed verbatim 2026-09-16. Items are administered interleaved (satisfaction, commitment, intimacy, trust, passion, love, repeated three times). Subscale membership follows the form's scoring section; its item-composition table labels item 18 'Satisfaction', which contradicts the scoring section (love = 6, 12, 18) and was treated as a typo."
